{"3889540":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"I Need to Fix My Dream Car (But I Work at a Junkyard)","steam_appid":3889540,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5101110],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3889540\/extras\/1121a70b39db9b725c6d007fcd6eb314.poster.avif?t=1789226019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3889540\/extras\/1121a70b39db9b725c6d007fcd6eb314.webm?t=1789226019\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3889540\/extras\/1121a70b39db9b725c6d007fcd6eb314.mp4?t=1789226019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig Through Junk<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break down piles of trash, scrap, broken machines, car parts, and forgotten junk. Every pile can hide something useful, valuable, or just weird.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore Your Dream Car<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money, buy missing parts, and rebuild a rusty old car piece by piece until your dream is ready to ride again.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Customer Orders<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange customers will arrive with strange requests. Find rare parts, prepare their cars, and get paid for your work.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rescue Dogs<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find lost dogs hiding in the junkyard, rescue them, give them a home, and let them help you while you work.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Everything<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools, improve your workflow, drive a forklift, and use the magnetic crane to clear bigger piles of junk faster.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Collectibles<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for lost collectible cards and other rare treasures hidden deep in the trash.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relax<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take breaks, enjoy the music, chill with your dogs, and embrace the cozy junkyard atmosphere.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3889540\/extras\/1121a70b39db9b725c6d007fcd6eb314.poster.avif?t=1789226019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3889540\/extras\/1121a70b39db9b725c6d007fcd6eb314.webm?t=1789226019\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3889540\/extras\/1121a70b39db9b725c6d007fcd6eb314.mp4?t=1789226019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig Through Junk<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break down piles of trash, scrap, broken machines, car parts, and forgotten junk. Every pile can hide something useful, valuable, or just weird.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore Your Dream Car<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money, buy missing parts, and rebuild a rusty old car piece by piece until your dream is ready to ride again.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Customer Orders<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange customers will arrive with strange requests. Find rare parts, prepare their cars, and get paid for your work.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rescue Dogs<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find lost dogs hiding in the junkyard, rescue them, give them a home, and let them help you while you work.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Everything<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools, improve your workflow, drive a forklift, and use the magnetic crane to clear bigger piles of junk faster.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Collectibles<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >